    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well-presented 3 bedroomed enterraced residence situated at the popular Glencarra development, Knock, Co. Mayo. The property is ideally situated within walking distance of knock village and all of its amenities. The property offers convenience and comfort in a well established setting. Glencarra is a highly sought after residential estate with central green area that enhances its overall appeal. \r\n\r\nThe Property is situated approximately 300 metres from the center of Knock village, 11km from Ballyhaunis, 10km from Claremorris and 15km from Ireland West Airport, Knock.\r\n\r\nSome of its features include, tiled flooring in the entrance hallway, kitchen and dining room, fireplace in the sitting room, fitted kitchen, timber flooring upstairs in all bedrooms, side entrance to the rear with garden shed, double glazed PVC windows, windows and doors, oil-fired central heating, off street parking, excellent transport links.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of Entrance hallway, Living room, Kitchen/ Dining room, Utility room, Guest WC, 3 bedrooms, 1 ensuite, 1 bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal family home and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.1m x 1.16m \r\nEntire flooring, 1 radiator, coving to ceiling with center piece.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.0m x 3.55m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator, coving to ceiling with centre piece. Fireplace with sandstone and casarned surround. 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - 4.84m x 3.1m \r\nTiled flooring and splash back area, coving to ceiling, spotlights to ceiling, fitted kitchen, granite worktop, breakfast bar, french doors to rear patio.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.15m x 2.03m \r\nTiled flooring, pump for washing machine and dryer fitted units.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC - 2.155m x 1.46m \r\nTiled flooring, walls, WC and handbasin.\r\n\r\nUpstairs - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.71m x 3.63m \r\nTimber flooring, coving to ceiling, centre piece, built in wardrobes, 1 radiator\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.976m x 0.979m \r\nTiled flooring and walls, WC hand basin and shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.091m x 2.996m \r\nTimber flooring, fitted units, coving to ceiling with centre piece, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.71m \r\nWC handbasin, bath, 1 radiator, tiled flooring and walls.\r\n\r\nUpstairs to attic - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.39m x 3.8m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb 3-bedroom end terrace home in a excellent condition.\r\nHighly sought after residentail location.\r\nWalking distance to all town amenties.\r\nLarge green area.\r\nOff street parking for 2 cars.\r\nPrivate rear garden with shed for extra storage.\r\nIdeal starter home or investment property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From the roundabout in Knock village, take the kiltimagh road, Glencarra is on your right handside. Look out for the DNG Gilligan sign. F12 PT97"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Highly recommended and by appointment only."
      }
